OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F362A1786965500
OL,3,CMan charged with assaulting emergency
OL,4,Cworkers after rooftop standoff
OL,6,FA man has been charged with with
OL,7,Fassaulting two emergency workers after
OL,8,Fstand-off with riot police that lasted
OL,9,Ffor two days.
OL,11,FGreater Manchester Police released
OL,12,Ffootage showing the moment an officer
OL,13,Fclimbed the ladder onto the roof of a
OL,14,Fback porch in Ash Street, in Salford,
OL,15,Fand grabbed the sleeping man.
OL,17,FHe was pulled down the ladder, before
OL,18,Fbeing arrested by officers in the
OL,19,Fgarden of the property.
OL,1,W~k4j5 hw1~k4~c1 hw}h7}j7}      G1/4
