PN,36202
SC,0002
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F362A1786965500
OL,3,CMan charged with assaulting emergency
OL,4,Cworkers after rooftop standoff
OL,6,FThe force said two police officers
OL,7,Fsuffered minor injuries during the
OL,8,Fincident on 15 August.
OL,10,FSimon Harris faces eight charges,
OL,11,Fincluding two counts of assaulting an
OL,12,Femergency worker, four counts of
OL,13,Fcriminal damage, intentionally or
OL,14,Frecklessly causing a public nuisance,
OL,15,Fand burglary dwelling and theft.
OL,17,FThe 37-year-old, of no fixed address,
OL,18,Fis due to appear at Manchester and
OL,19,FSalford Magistrates' Court on 17
OL,20,FAugust.
OL,1,W~k4j5 hw1~k4~c1 hw}h7}j7}      G2/4
