FL,363,360,120,260,000,100
PN,36203
SC,0003
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F362A1786965500
OL,3,CMan charged with assaulting emergency
OL,4,Cworkers after rooftop standoff
OL,6,FDetective Chief Inspector Helen
OL,7,FBagnall thanked members of the public
OL,8,Ffollowing the man's arrest, which came
OL,9,Fafter a two-day emergency service
OL,10,Fresponse.
OL,12,FShe said: "This was an extensive use
OL,13,Fof vital policing resources and
OL,14,Fclearly demonstrates the dangers our
OL,15,Fofficers face on a daily basis in
OL,16,Forder to protect the people of Greater
OL,17,FManchester.
OL,19,F"Two of our officers suffered minor
OL,20,Finjuries during this incident.
OL,26,@tD@KOU{D@AOU
