OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F362A1786965500
OL,3,CMan charged with assaulting emergency
OL,4,Cworkers after rooftop standoff
OL,6,F"I would like to reiterate my thanks
OL,7,Fto the people of Salford for their
OL,8,Fpatience and understanding whilst
OL,9,Femergency service personnel dealt with
OL,10,Fthis incident."
